    "chunk_text": "urh an lytel \u00f0yrel. NO06A16 \u00dea gestod seo cweorn sona, ond se mon ablindode. NO06A18 Ond hyne \u00f0a o\u00f0re swi\u00f0e afyrhte \u00feanon l\u00e6ddon, ond he s\u00e6gde \u00feam bro\u00f0rum \u00fe\u00e6s mynstres NO06A20 Ond \u00f0a o\u00f0re d\u00e6ge onleat he wepende to \u00f0\u00e6s abbodes fotum ond him b\u00e6d forgifnesse, NO07A1 On VII d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00f0 wintres fruma. NO07A2 Se winter hafa\u00f0 tu ond hundnigontig daga, ond \u00f0onne gonga\u00f0 \u00fea VII steorran up on \u00e6fen NO08A1 On \u00f0one eahto\u00f0an d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00f0 \u00f0ara martyra \u00ferowung \u00fee we nemna\u00f0 on gewritum NO08A5 \u00d0\u00e6t w\u00e6ron IIII stancr\u00e6ftigan in Rome. NO08A6 \u00de\u00e6r w\u00e6s samod VI hund cr\u00e6ftigena ond XXII ond n\u00e6ron nane o\u00f0re him gelice. NO08A8 Hy gesenedon \u00e6lce morgen heora iserngeloman, ond \u00f0onne n\u00e6ron hy na tobrocene, ac hy NO08A11 \u00d0a w\u00e6s \u00f0ara cr\u00e6ftigena on naman an Simplicus. NO08A12 \u00d0a lyfde se goda ond fulwihte onfeng, ond \u00f0a si\u00f0\u00f0an dyde he eall \u00f0\u00e6t \u00f0a o\u00f0re dydon. NO08A13 \u00dea sealde god \u00feissum V cr\u00e6ftegum maran gyfa \u00feonne \u00f0am o\u00f0rum. NO08A15 \u00d0a wregdon \u00f0a o\u00f0re cr\u00e6ftigan hy to \u00f0am casere ond s\u00e6gdon him \u00fe\u00e6t hy w\u00e6ron Cristene, NO08A19 \u00dea yrsode se casere ond het hy cwice beluc",
